  "goodToKnow": "Die Streitigkeit is a dispute or quarrel, almost always in the plural: Streitigkeiten unter Nachbarn, rechtliche Streitigkeiten. It's more formal than der Streit, which is the everyday word and has no common plural of its own; Streitigkeiten fills that gap. Neighbour disputes are a German classic, from hedges to noise during the Ruhezeiten, and many end at the Schiedsamt (local mediator) or in court."
